  "note": "Lunenburg High School, named on the page itself: 'LUNENBURG HIGH SCHOOL / Faculty/Staff Roster / 2019-2020' (lines 1-3). TWO DIFFERENT LAYOUTS ON ONE PAGE. Lines 4-6 are a FOUR-column ROLE-THEN-NAME table -- role at x=0.109 with its name at x=0.235, and a second role at x=0.359 with its name at x=0.471 -- so each of those lines yields two entries. From line 7 down the page is a two-column list of bare names under department headings (x=0.109 left, x=0.360 right), so role_raw is '' for lines 8-27 and the department is carried in grade_or_dept. Lines 4-6 sit ABOVE the first department heading and so carry grade_or_dept ''. Five names are printed with a trailing asterisk -- Jennifer Miller*, Julia Callahan*, Dawn Gearin*, Warren Stevenson*, Peggy Proctor* -- and the asterisk is kept in 'name' exactly as printed. No key for it appears anywhere on the page, so what it marks (department head is the obvious guess) is not established here. Timothy Macuga is printed twice, on line 10 under Language Arts and line 19 under Social Studies; both are recorded, as printed. CONVENTION: lines 20 and 22 hold a heading in one column and an entry in the other and are listed under 'entries' only. Line 28 is the printed page number 133."
